// matrix A through llms_q4l_mv_kxh_impl<NA, 3, true> and matrix B through <NB, 3, true>, the SAME instantiations the separate three-row
// dispatches use (the k-row site: nr 8, or 4 when Q4L_KSEL meets out_dim <= 512; K3X + HX -> the _bxh kernels; LEAN2 rides the NSG
